1
00:00:00,211 --> 00:00:02,141
(Leonard:)Guys, everyone is involved
in this, okay?

2
00:00:02,146 --> 00:00:03,546
(Leonard:)Howard's invention,

3
00:00:03,548 --> 00:00:05,278
(Amy:)Sheldon's math,
my original theory

4
00:00:05,283 --> 00:00:07,613
(Leonard:)that space-time was like
a supercooled liquid.

5
00:00:07,618 --> 00:00:09,518
(Leonard:)Which I'm sure
Penny would've mentioned

6
00:00:09,520 --> 00:00:12,290
(Leonard:)if she wasn't working
on that hangnail right now.

7
00:00:13,391 --> 00:00:15,591
(Amy:)What?

8
00:00:16,794 --> 00:00:18,764
(Howard:)Honey, this is fine.

9
00:00:18,763 --> 00:00:21,333
(Bernadette:)If you want to sign a contract
that Sheldon whipped up,

10
00:00:21,332 --> 00:00:22,302
(Bernadette:)go ahead.

11
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:24,230
(Howard:)Can I talk to you in the hall?

12
00:00:24,235 --> 00:00:26,135
(Penny:)Sure.
Excuse us.

13
00:00:28,573 --> 00:00:30,243
(Sheldon:)Hey, Leonard.
What?

14
00:00:30,241 --> 00:00:33,271
(Sheldon:)If she doesn't think that
we should apply for this patent,

15
00:00:33,277 --> 00:00:36,147
(Sheldon:)she's being patently absurd.

16
00:00:37,949 --> 00:00:39,649
(Leonard:)Good one.

17
00:00:39,650 --> 00:00:41,850
(Sheldon:)Okay, you got it.

18
00:00:41,852 --> 00:00:45,022
(Sheldon:)See, I was afraid
it was a thinker.

19
00:00:46,591 --> 00:00:48,691
(Howard:)What are you doing?
I just want to make sure

20
00:00:48,693 --> 00:00:49,923
(Bernadette:)you've thought this through.

21
00:00:49,927 --> 00:00:51,757
(Howard:)What's to think about?
We have an invention

22
00:00:51,762 --> 00:00:53,162
(Howard:)and want to move forward.

23
00:00:53,164 --> 00:00:56,334
(Bernadette:)Howie, you're about
to form a legal partnership

24
00:00:56,334 --> 00:01:00,024
(Bernadette:)with Sheldon Cooper.

